    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Data Analysis for the Temporal Task Scheduling Project (Experiment 1)\"\nauthor: \"Przemyslaw Marcowski, PhD\"\ndate: \"today\"\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code  code-fold=\"true\"}\nlibrary(tidyverse)\nlibrary(brms)\nlibrary(easystats)\nlibrary(patchwork)\nlibrary(see)\n\n# Select confidence interval\nci_level <- 0.99\nemmeans::emm_options(level = ci_level)\n\nset.seed(42) # for reproducibility\n\n# Prepare data for each experiment\n# source(\"../R/prepare_data.R\") # Optional: prepares to `data/prepared/`\n```\n:::\n\n\n# Data Import\n\nPrepared data from Experiment 1, where participants chose between easy/boring and hard/interesting tasks under immediate and future timing conditions.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Read prepared data from Experiment 1\nexp1_freq_data <- readRDS(\"../data/prepared/exp1.Rds\")\n\nexp1_freq_data\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<div data-pagedtable=\"false\">\n  <script data-pagedtable-source type=\"application/json\">\n{\"columns\":[{\"label\":[\"id\"],\"name\":[1],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"sex\"],\"name\":[2],\"type\":[\"fct\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"age\"],\"name\":[3],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"time\"],\"name\":[4],\"type\":[\"fct\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"choice\"],\"name\":[5],\"type\":[\"fct\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]}],\"data\":[{\"1\":\"1\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Tomorrow\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"2\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"20\",\"4\":\"Tomorrow\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"3\",\"2\":\"Male\",\"3\":\"20\",\"4\":\"Tomorrow\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"4\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Tomorrow\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"5\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Tomorrow\",\"5\":\"Hard and Interesting\"},{\"1\":\"6\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"20\",\"4\":\"Tomorrow\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"7\",\"2\":\"F