\":\"121\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Tomorrow\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"122\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Tomorrow\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"123\",\"2\":\"Male\",\"3\":\"18\",\"4\":\"Tomorrow\",\"5\":\"Hard and Interesting\"},{\"1\":\"124\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Tomorrow\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"125\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"21\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Hard and Interesting\"},{\"1\":\"126\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"127\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"20\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"128\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"20\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"129\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"130\",\"2\":\"Male\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Hard and Interesting\"},{\"1\":\"131\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Hard and Interesting\"},{\"1\":\"132\",\"2\":\"Male\",\"3\":\"20\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"133\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Hard and Interesting\"},{\"1\":\"134\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"135\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"136\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"20\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"138\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"139\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"18\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"140\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Hard and Interesting\"},{\"1\":\"141\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"20\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Hard and Interesting\"},{\"1\":\"142\",\"2\":\"Male\",\"3\":\"19\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"},{\"1\":\"143\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"21\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Hard and Interesting\"},{\"1\":\"144\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"20\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Hard and Interesting\"},{\"1\":\"145\",\"2\":\"Female\",\"3\":\"20\",\"4\":\"Future\",\"5\":\"Easy and Boring\"}],\"options\":{\"columns\":{\"min\":{},\"max\":[10]},\"rows\":{\"min\":[10],\"max\":[10]},\"pages\":{}}}\n  </script>\n</div>\n`````\n:::\n:::\n\n\n# Demographics\n\n## Sample Size\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Number of participants\nn_distinct(exp1_freq_data$id)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n[1] 141\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Age Statistics\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Age statistics\nmean(exp1_freq_data$age)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n[1] 19.50355\n```\n\n\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nsd(exp1_freq_data$age)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n[1] 1.222551\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Demographics by Sex\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Demographics by sex\nexp1_freq_data %>%\n  group_by(sex) %>%\n  summarize(\n    n = n_distinct(id),\n    mean_age = mean(age),\n    sd_age = sd(age)\n  )\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<div data-pagedtable=\"false\">\n  <script data-pagedtable-source type=\"application/json\">\n{\"columns\":[{\"label\":[\"sex\"],\"name\":[1],\"type\":[\"fct\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"n\"],\"name\":[2],\"type\":[\"int\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"mean_age\"],\"name\":[3],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"sd_age\"],\"name\":[4],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]}],\"data\":[{\"1\":\"Female\",\"2\":\"113\",\"3\":\"19.49558\",\"4\":\"1.036166\"},{\"1\":\"Male\",\"2\":\"28\",\"3\":\"19.53571\",\"4\":\"1.815206\"}],\"options\":{\"columns\":{\"min\":{},\"max\":[10]},\"rows\":{\"min\":[10],\"max\":[10]},\"pages\":{}}}\n  </script>\n</div>\n`````\n:::\n:::\n\n\n# Preference Proportions\n\nTask choice counts and proportions by timing condition.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Calculate preference proportions\nexp1_prop_table <-\n  exp1_freq_data %>%\n  count(time, choice) %>%\n  group_by(time) %>%\n  mutate(\n    total = sum(n),\n    prop = n / total\n  ) %>%\n  arrange(time)\n\nexp1_prop_table\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<div data-pagedtable=\"false\">\n  <script data-pagedtable-source type=\"application/json\">\n{\"columns\":[{\"label\":[\"time\"],\"name\":[1],\"type\":[\"fct\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"choice\"],\"name\":[2],\"type\":[\"fct\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"n\"],\"name\":[3],\"type\":[\"int\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"total\"],\"name\":[4],\"type\":[\"int\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"prop\"],\"name\":[5],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]}],\"data\":[{\"1\":\"Tomorrow\",\"2\":\"Easy and Boring\",\"3\":\"52\",\"4\":\"64\",\"5\":\"0.8125000\"},{\"1\":\"Tomorrow\",\"2\":\"Hard and Interesting\",\"3\":\"12\",\"4\":\"64\",\"5\":\"0.1875000\"},{\"1\":\"Future\",\"2\":\"Easy and Boring\",\"3\":\"45\",\"4\":\"77\",\"5\":\"0.5844156\"},{\"1\":\"Future\",\"2\":\"Hard and Interesting\",\"3\":\"32\",\"4\":\"77\",\"5\":\"0.4155844\"}],\"options\":{\"columns\":{\"min\":{},\"max\":[10]},\"rows\":{\"min\":[10],\"max\":[10]},\"pages\":{}}}\n  </script>\n</div>\n`````\n:::\n:::\n\n\n# Binomial Model\n\nBinomial logit model predicting choice counts from task type, timing condition, and their interaction.\n\n## Model Specification\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Model formula and family\nexp1_model_formula <- bf(paste0(\"n | trials(total) ~ choice * time\"))\nexp1_model_family <- brmsfamily(\"binomial\", \"logit\")\nexp1_model_priors <- get_prior(exp1_model_formula, data = exp1_prop_table, family = exp1_model_family)\n\nexp1_model_priors\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<div data-pagedtable=\"false\">\n  <script data-pagedtable-source type=\"application/json\">\n{\"columns\":[{\"label\":[\"prior\"],\"name\":[1],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"class\"],\"name\":[2],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"coef\"],\"name\":[3],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"group\"],\"name\":[4],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"resp\"],\"name\":[5],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"dpar\"],\"name\":[6],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"nlpar\"],\"name\":[7],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"lb\"],\"name\":[8],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"ub\"],\"name\":[9],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"tag\"],\"name\":[10],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"source\"],\"name\":[11],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]}],\"data\":[{\"1\":\"\",\"2\":\"b\",\"3\":\"\",\"4\":\"\",\"5\":\"\",\"6\":\"\",\"7\":\"\",\"8\":\"\",\"9\":\"\",\"10\":\"\",\"11\":\"default\"},{\"1\":\"\",\"2\":\"b\",\"3\":\"choiceHardandInteresting\",\"4\":\"\",\"5\":\"\",\"6\":\"\",\"7\":\"\",\"8\":\"\",\"9\":\"\",\"10\":\"\",\"11\":\"default\"},{\"1\":\"\",\"2\":\"b\",\"3\":\"choiceHardandInteresting:timeFuture\",\"4\":\"\",\"5\":\"\",\"6\":\"\",\"7\":\"\",\"8\":\"\",\"9\":\"\",\"10\":\"\",\"11\":\"default\"},{\"1\":\"\",\"2\":\"b\",\"3\":\"timeFuture\",\"4\":\"\",\"5\":\"\",\"6\":\"\",\"7\":\"\",\"8\":\"\",\"9\":\"\",\"10\":\"\",\"11\":\"default\"},{\"1\":\"student_t(3, 0, 2.5)\",\"2\":\"Intercept\",\"3\":\"\",\"4\":\"\",\"5\":\"\",\"6\":\"\",\"7\":\"\",\"8\":\"\",\"9\":\"\",\"10\":\"\",\"11\":\"default\"}],\"options\":{\"columns\":{\"min\":{},\"max\":[10]},\"rows\":{\"min\":[10],\"max\":[10]},\"pages\":{}}}\n  </script>\n</div>\n`````\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Model Fitting\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Fit a binomial model with identity link\nexp1_model_fit <-\n  brm(\n    exp1_model_formula,\n    data = exp1_prop_table, family = exp1_model_family, prior = exp1_model_priors,\n    iter = 4000, warmup = 2000, chains = 4, cores = 4,\n    file = \"../output/exp1_binomial_model_fit\"\n  )\n```\n:::\n\n\n## Model Summary\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Inspect model\nsummary(exp1_model_fit, prob = ci_level)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n Family: binomial \n  Links: mu = logit \nFormula: n | trials(total) ~ choice * time \n   Data: d0_prop (Number of observations: 4) \n  Draws: 4 chains, each with iter = 4000; warmup = 2000; thin = 1;\n         total post-warmup draws = 8000\n\nRegression Coefficients:\n                      Estimate Est.Error l-99% CI u-99% CI Rhat Bulk_ESS\nIntercept                 1.50      0.33     0.70     2.45 1.00     3274\nchoiceHard               -2.99      0.46    -4.23    -1.83 1.00     3129\ntimeFuture               -1.15      0.40    -2.23    -0.13 1.00     3193\nchoiceHard:timeFuture     2.30      0.57     0.86     3.82 1.00     2768\n                      Tail_ESS\nIntercept                 3899\nchoiceHard                4185\ntimeFuture                4339\nchoiceHard:timeFuture     3688\n\nDraws were sampled using sampling(NUTS). For each parameter, Bulk_ESS\nand Tail_ESS are effective sample size measures, and Rhat is the potential\nscale reduction factor on split chains (at convergence, Rhat = 1).\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Posterior Description\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Describe posterior\nexp1_posterior_desc <- bayestestR::describe_posterior(exp1_model_fit, ci = ci_level, rope_ci = ci_level)\n\nexp1_posterior_desc\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<div data-pagedtable=\"false\">\n  <script data-pagedtable-source type=\"application/json\">\n{\"columns\":[{\"label\":[\"\"],\"name\":[\"_rn_\"],\"type\":[\"\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"Parameter\"],\"name\":[1],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"Median\"],\"name\":[2],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"CI\"],\"name\":[3],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"CI_low\"],\"name\":[4],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"CI_high\"],\"name\":[5],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"pd\"],\"name\":[6],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"ROPE_CI\"],\"name\":[7],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"ROPE_low\"],\"name\":[8],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"ROPE_high\"],\"name\":[9],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"ROPE_Percentage\"],\"name\":[10],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"Rhat\"],\"name\":[11],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"ESS\"],\"name\":[12],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]}],\"data\":[{\"1\":\"b_Intercept\",\"2\":\"1.497787\",\"3\":\"0.99\",\"4\":\"0.7028461\",\"5\":\"2.4474538\",\"6\":\"1.0000\",\"7\":\"0.99\",\"8\":\"-0.1813799\",\"9\":\"0.1813799\",\"10\":\"0.000000000\",\"11\":\"1.000179\",\"12\":\"3227.046\",\"_rn_\":\"3\"},{\"1\":\"b_choiceHard\",\"2\":\"-2.992947\",\"3\":\"0.99\",\"4\":\"-4.2271722\",\"5\":\"-1.8294764\",\"6\":\"1.0000\",\"7\":\"0.99\",\"8\":\"-0.1813799\",\"9\":\"0.1813799\",\"10\":\"0.000000000\",\"11\":\"1.000005\",\"12\":\"3122.156\",\"_rn_\":\"1\"},{\"1\":\"b_timeFuture\",\"2\":\"-1.149098\",\"3\":\"0.99\",\"4\":\"-2.2327954\",\"5\":\"-0.1268619\",\"6\":\"0.9985\",\"7\":\"0.99\",\"8\":\"-0.1813799\",\"9\":\"0.1813799\",\"10\":\"0.002020202\",\"11\":\"1.000636\",\"12\":\"3178.514\",\"_rn_\":\"4\"},{\"1\":\"b_choiceHard:timeFuture\",\"2\":\"2.312005\",\"3\":\"0.99\",\"4\":\"0.8605195\",\"5\":\"3.8211364\",\"6\":\"1.0000\",\"7\":\"0.99\",\"8\":\"-0.1813799\",\"9\":\"0.1813799\",\"10\":\"0.000000000\",\"11\":\"1.000273\",\"12\":\"2770.086\",\"_rn_\":\"2\"}],\"options\":{\"columns\":{\"min\":{},\"max\":[10]},\"rows\":{\"min\":[10],\"max\":[10]},\"pages\":{}}}\n  </script>\n</div>\n`````\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Save Coefficients\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Save model coefficients (Optional: saves to `output/`)\n# write_csv(exp1_posterior_desc, \"../output/exp1_model_coefficients.csv\")\n```\n:::\n\n\n# Marginal Means and Contrasts\n\nEstimated marginal means and pairwise contrasts on the response scale, comparing choice probabilities between task types within each timing condition.\n\n## Estimated Marginal Means\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Calculate marginal means and contrasts\nexp1_emmeans <- emmeans::emmeans(exp1_model_fit, pairwise ~ choice | time, regrid = \"response\", infer = TRUE, adjust = \"mvt\")\nexp1_marginal_means <- as.data.frame(summary(exp1_emmeans$emmeans, level = ci_level))\n\nexp1_marginal_means\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<div data-pagedtable=\"false\">\n  <script data-pagedtable-source type=\"application/json\">\n{\"columns\":[{\"label\":[\"\"],\"name\":[\"_rn_\"],\"type\":[\"\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"choice\"],\"name\":[1],\"type\":[\"fct\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"time\"],\"name\":[2],\"type\":[\"fct\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"prob\"],\"name\":[3],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"lower.HPD\"],\"name\":[4],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"upper.HPD\"],\"name\":[5],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]}],\"data\":[{\"1\":\"Easy\",\"2\":\"Tomorrow\",\"3\":\"0.8172441\",\"4\":\"0.67957748\",\"5\":\"0.9267740\",\"_rn_\":\"1\"},{\"1\":\"Hard\",\"2\":\"Tomorrow\",\"3\":\"0.1855274\",\"4\":\"0.08530783\",\"5\":\"0.3224148\",\"_rn_\":\"2\"},{\"1\":\"Easy\",\"2\":\"Future\",\"3\":\"0.5854639\",\"4\":\"0.44000476\",\"5\":\"0.7232397\",\"_rn_\":\"3\"},{\"1\":\"Hard\",\"2\":\"Future\",\"3\":\"0.4149249\",\"4\":\"0.28061708\",\"5\":\"0.5641290\",\"_rn_\":\"4\"}],\"options\":{\"columns\":{\"min\":{},\"max\":[10]},\"rows\":{\"min\":[10],\"max\":[10]},\"pages\":{}}}\n  </script>\n</div>\n`````\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Save Marginal Means\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Save marginal means (Optional: saves to `output/`)\n# write_csv(exp1_marginal_means, \"../output/exp1_marginal_means.csv\")\n```\n:::\n\n\n## Pairwise Contrasts\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Pairwise contrasts\nexp1_contrasts <- as.data.frame(summary(exp1_emmeans$contrasts, level = ci_level))\nexp1_contrasts$sig <- with(exp1_contrasts, ifelse(lower.HPD <= 0 & upper.HPD >= 0, \"\", \"*\"))\n\nexp1_contrasts\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<div data-pagedtable=\"false\">\n  <script data-pagedtable-source type=\"application/json\">\n{\"columns\":[{\"label\":[\"\"],\"name\":[\"_rn_\"],\"type\":[\"\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"contrast\"],\"name\":[1],\"type\":[\"fct\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"time\"],\"name\":[2],\"type\":[\"fct\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"estimate\"],\"name\":[3],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"lower.HPD\"],\"name\":[4],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"upper.HPD\"],\"name\":[5],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"sig\"],\"name\":[6],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]}],\"data\":[{\"1\":\"Easy - Hard\",\"2\":\"Tomorrow\",\"3\":\"0.6293996\",\"4\":\"0.42886938\",\"5\":\"0.7794785\",\"6\":\"*\",\"_rn_\":\"1\"},{\"1\":\"Easy - Hard\",\"2\":\"Future\",\"3\":\"0.1702216\",\"4\":\"-0.03169985\",\"5\":\"0.3627822\",\"6\":\"\",\"_rn_\":\"2\"}],\"options\":{\"columns\":{\"min\":{},\"max\":[10]},\"rows\":{\"min\":[10],\"max\":[10]},\"pages\":{}}}\n  </script>\n</div>\n`````\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Save Contrasts\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Save contrasts (Optional: saves to `output/`)\n# write_csv(exp1_contrasts, \"../output/exp1_pairwise_contrasts.csv\")\n```\n:::\n\n\n# Visualization\n\nMarginal choice probabilities and pairwise differences across timing conditions.\n\n## Marginal Task Preference\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Visualize means across conditions\nexp1_means_plot <-\n  exp1_marginal_means %>%\n  ggplot(aes(x = time, y = prob, group = choice, color = choice)) +\n  geom_point(size = 1) +\n  geom_line(linewidth = 0.5) +\n  geom_errorbar(aes(ymin = lower.HPD, ymax = upper.HPD), width = 0.1, linewidth = 0.5) +\n  geom_hline(yintercept = 0.5, linetype = \"dashed\") +\n  labs(\n    title = \"Marginal Task Preference\",\n    x = \"Task Delay\", y = \"P(Choose)\",\n    color = \"Task Type\"\n  ) +\n  coord_cartesian(ylim = c(0, 1)) +\n  scale_color_grey(labels = c(\"Easy\" = \"Easy and Boring\", \"Hard\" = \"Hard and Interesting\")) +\n  theme_modern() +\n  theme(\n    aspect.ratio = 1,\n    plot.title = element_text(hjust = 0.9),\n    plot.margin = unit(c(0, 3, 0, 0), \"lines\"),\n    strip.background = element_rect(color = \"transparent\", fill = \"transparent\")\n  )\n\nexp1_means_plot\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](analysis_exp1_files/figure-html/exp1-means-plot-1.png){width=672}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Differences in Task Preference\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Visualize contrasts\nexp1_contrasts_plot <-\n  exp1_contrasts %>%\n  ggplot(aes(x = time, y = estimate, fill = time)) +\n  geom_hline(yintercept = 0, linetype = \"dashed\") +\n  geom_col(color = \"black\", width = 0.25, linewidth = 0.5) +\n  geom_errorbar(aes(ymin = lower.HPD, ymax = upper.HPD), width = 0.1, linewidth = 0.5) +\n  labs(\n    title = \"Differences in Task Preference\",\n    x = \"Task Delay\", y = \"P(Choose) Easy and Boring - Hard and Interesting\",\n    fill = \"Task Delay\"\n  ) +\n  guides(fill = \"none\") +\n  coord_flip(ylim = c(-1, 1)) +\n  scale_fill_manual(values = c(\"white\", \"white\")) +\n  theme_modern() +\n  theme(\n    aspect.ratio = 1,\n    plot.title = element_text(hjust = 1.1),\n    plot.margin = unit(c(0, 2, 0, 0), \"lines\"),\n    strip.background = element_rect(color = \"transparent\", fill = \"transparent\")\n  )\n\nexp1_contrasts_plot\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](analysis_exp1_files/figure-html/exp1-contrasts-plot-1.png){width=672}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Combined Figure\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Create and save figure 1\nfig1 <-\n  exp1_means_plot + exp1_contrasts_plot +\n    plot_layout(guides = \"collect\") +\n    plot_annotation(tag_levels = \"a\") &\n    theme(\n      plot.title = element_text(size = 12),\n      legend.position = \"bottom\"\n      )\n\nprint(fig1)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](analysis_exp1_files/figure-html/exp1-figure-1.png){width=672}\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nggsave(\"../output/fig1.png\", fig1, width = 10, height = 4)\n```\n:::\n\n\n# Session\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nsessionInfo()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\nR version 4.5.1 (2025-06-13 ucrt)\nPlatform: x86_64-w64-mingw32/x64\nRunning under: Windows 11 x64 (build 26200)\n\nMatrix products: default\n  LAPACK version 3.12.1\n\nlocale:\n[1] LC_COLLATE=English_United States.utf8 \n[2] LC_CTYPE=English_United States.utf8   \n[3] LC_MONETARY=English_United States.utf8\n[4] LC_NUMERIC=C                          \n[5] LC_TIME=English_United States.utf8    \n\ntime zone: America/Los_Angeles\ntzcode source: internal\n\nattached base packages:\n[1] stats     graphics  grDevices utils     datasets  methods   base     \n\nother attached packages:\n [1] patchwork_1.3.2    see_0.13.0         report_0.6.3       parameters_0.28.3 \n [5] performance_0.15.3 modelbased_0.13.1  insight_1.4.5      effectsize_1.0.1  \n [9] datawizard_1.3.0   correlation_0.8.8  bayestestR_0.17.0  easystats_0.7.5   \n[13] brms_2.23.0        Rcpp_1.1.1         lubridate_1.9.4    forcats_1.0.1     \n[17] stringr_1.6.0      dplyr_1.2.0        purrr_1.2.1        readr_2.1.6       \n[21] tidyr_1.3.2        tibble_3.3.1       ggplot2_4.0.2      tidyverse_2.0.0   \n\nloaded via a namespace (and not attached):\n [1] tidyselect_1.2.1      farver_2.1.2          loo_2.9.0            \n [4] S7_0.2.1              fastmap_1.2.0         TH.data_1.1-5        \n [7] tensorA_0.36.2.1      digest_0.6.39         estimability_1.5.1   \n[10] timechange_0.4.0      lifecycle_1.0.5       StanHeaders_2.32.10  \n[13] survival_3.8-6        magrittr_2.0.4        posterior_1.